{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08348","headline":"登敬亭山南望怀古赠窦主簿 · 李白","name":"登敬亭山南望怀古赠窦主簿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"敬亭一回首，目尽天南端。\n仙者五六人，常闻此游盘。\n谿流琴高水，石耸麻姑坛。\n白龙降陵阳，黄鹤呼子安。\n羽化骑日月，云行翼鸳鸾。\n下视宇宙间，四溟皆波澜。\n汰绝目下事，从之复何难。\n百岁落半途，前期浩漫漫。\n强食不成味，清晨起长叹。\n愿随子明去，链火烧金丹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_08348.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_08348","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}